# A change too big for the band: an 80-line new file, reviewed on a screen of
# its own (fx reviews every file there; xfx brings a change here once its
# review outgrows the band). Walked back toward its head, then refused.
gateway approvals-big.json
work approvals-ws
fx: seed approvals-fx-settings.json
fx: env FX_PERMISSION_MODE=ask
xfx: env XFX_PERMISSION_MODE=ask
wait 3
type write a big file
key Enter
wait 3
snap write-big
xfx: key C-p C-p C-p
fx: key WheelUpPane
wait 0.5
snap write-big-walked
key 3
wait 2.5
snap end
